          <p>Over time it grew into one of Islamabad's most-visited family destinations, known for open lawns, lake viewpoints, children's activities and casual food stalls. Management, entry policy and activity availability are set by the CDA and can change, so confirm current details before a special trip.</p>
          <p>Ecologically, Rawal Lake and its shoreline are part of the capital's urban green network, valued for birdlife and as a calm counterpoint to the city's busy center—exactly why the park's appeal is more about "staying" than "doing."</p>
